      equipment: '2 or 3 standard 52-card packs with jokers, chips/money for pot, score sheet',
      dealing: 'All 5 rounds deal 10 cards to each player (unlike Push which increases). Remaining cards form stock. Turn up one card to start discard pile (cannot be wild - if 2 or joker, bury and turn up next).',
    },
